{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>The branches of his skin</b> — the branches of his skin, by way of metaphor." "<b>It devours his branches</b> — they are his sons." "<b>Firstborn of death</b> — strength, or beginning; and the sense is that death is firstborn in his coming."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:55.903609698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}